WEBVTT

00:07:59.328 --> 00:08:00.986
He went out and did an experiment.

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:03.925
He asked all his friends
that he thought were good physicists,

00:08:03.949 --> 00:08:06.294
"Was it your mom or your pop
that influenced you?"

00:08:06.318 --> 00:08:08.281
They were all men,

00:08:08.305 --> 00:08:10.935
and to a man, every single
one of them said,

00:08:10.959 --> 00:08:12.183
"My mother."

00:08:12.207 --> 00:08:15.274
(Laughter)

00:08:15.298 --> 00:08:19.298
There went that theory,
down the trash can of history.

00:08:19.322 --> 00:08:20.426
(Laughter)

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:23.252
But he was very excited
that he had finally met somebody

00:08:23.276 --> 00:08:26.872
who had the same experience
with his father

00:08:26.896 --> 00:08:28.331
as he had with his father.

00:08:28.355 --> 00:08:32.480
And for some time, he was convinced
this was the reason we got along so well.